    "body": "Visit https://code.visualstudio.com/docs on Chrome on Android - notice the top banner saying \"This site uses cookies for analytics, personalized content and ads. By continuing to browse this site, you agree to this use. Learn more.\"\r\n\r\nThis banner cannot be removed and - unlike on Chrome on Windows 10 - does not disappear after using the site, for example, reloading or navigating.\r\n\r\nChrome 72.0.3626.121 on OnePlus 3T with Android 8.0.0, same on Huawei Mate 10 Pro with Android 9.\r\n\r\nI originally posted this as https://github.com/MicrosoftDocs/visualstudio-docs/issues/2885#event-2210674178, but was (correctly) sent here instead. ",
